	column special = ```
			
			IF(gravity[AVGGRAVITYSCORE] > PERCENTILE.INC(gravity[AVGGRAVITYSCORE], 0.95)
			|| gravity[PTS] > PERCENTILE.INC(gravity[PTS], 0.95) || gravity[AVGGRAVITYSCORE] < PERCENTILE.INC(gravity[AVGGRAVITYSCORE], 0.01) 
			|| gravity[PTS] < PERCENTILE.INC(gravity[PTS], 0.01), "special", "not")
			```
